\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Architectural diagram of the Hybrid Diffusion model. A pre-trained, frozen causal Vision-Language-Action model tokenizes and processes multimodal inputs. The final contextualized causal token is extracted and serves as the conditioning vector for a multi-layer Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Model (DDPM) head, which progressively denoises random noise into a structured, continuous action sequence.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
